r-substring-no-properties' strips the\n677:A runaway is the model degrading into a repetition loop (repeated\n696:(defun iar--cycle-cross-response-repetition-p (start end)\n698:last `iar-cycle-cross-response-window' responses with a cumulative count\n699:at or above `iar-cycle-cross-response-threshold'. The deepseek-v4-flash\n707:state's :cross-rep-window (a list of (hash . count) entries, oldest\n708:first, capped at `iar-cycle-cross-response-window'). On each call the\n715:           (window (plist-get state :cross-rep-window))\n747:        (while (> (length window) iar-cycle-cross-response-window)\n751:               (setq iar--cycle-state (plist-put iar--cycle-state :cross-rep-window window)))\n753:               (setq iar--one-shot-state (plist-put iar--one-shot-state :cross-rep-window window)))))\n754:      (>= max-count iar-cycle-cross-response-threshold))))\n904:                ;; repetition loop (repeated text, no tool call). Give it\n922:               ((iar--cycle-cross-response-repetition-p start end)\n923:                ;; Cross-response repetition: the SAME line repeated\n931:                ;; Shares :runaway-recovery-given so a cross-response\n935:                      (message \"[%s] Cross-response repetition (2nd fire) -- ending cycle\" agent)\n940:                    (message \"[%s] Cross-response repetition detected -- requesting recovery\" agent)\n\n[t+00:46/30:00 c11/120]"}]
